Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:49.67,Hook,,0,0,0,,CON TODO SU DINERO\NENCIMA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Cometí un error.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:02.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Traigo todo mi dinero\Nencima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, ya lo vi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oh, hay varios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No metí mi dinero al\Ncajero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Si me muero, puedo\Nperderlo todo otra vez,\N¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Si viene un tiburón y me\Nmata,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}me voy a volver loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Uy, es una anguila.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, no, estoy frito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy frito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, mierda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Seguro también pierdo mi\Ndinero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Debí verlo venir y\Nreaccionar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:35.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}con mi arpón, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Seguro voy a estar bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:39.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a estar bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:40.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:41.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Bueno, hablé demasiado\Npronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mejor me pongo a la\Nofensiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:47.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es lo que hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo soy el tiburón.
